  "name": "Demolish (Ex)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, an engineer has come to understand the key workings of mechanical devices and constructs so well that he can strike constructs or machinery for an additional +1d6 points of damage as long as he is using a blunt or piercing melee weapon. This increases by +1d6 every three levels after 3rd (+2d6 at 6th, +3d6 at 9th, +4d6 at 12th, +5d6 at 15th, +6d6 at 18th). In addition, the engineer can ignore up to 3 points of hardness/damage reduction against any construct. This increases by 3 every three levels after 3rd.</p>",
